WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.000
SAYONARA, FA

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.890
Even though we're not that
far from the colonies of Side 1,

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.760
Mashymre came after the
Argama with his Hamma-Hamma.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:54.640
Knowing him, it won't be long till
a second attack wave hits us.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.020
Watch out for the rocks!
Maintain 360-degree surveillance!

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:02.860
Aye, sir!
360-degree surveillance!

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.870
I can still see the lights
of Shangri-La.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.620
But, Kamille...

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.290
I...

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.920
Should I stay here,
aboard the Argama?

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.630
Miss Fa? Where should
I take these box lunches?

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.880
Huh? Oh, I'll join you in a minute.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:33.640
I have visual on the
La Vie en Rose.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.230
Right!
Magnify it on the screen.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.230
Aye, sir!

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:40.310
No doubt about it.
Hasn't Roux Louka left yet?

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:43.320
The La Vie en Rose
is so close...

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.740
She didn't get lost
aboard the ship, did she? Well?

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:50.240
Yeah, right there! Yank that
panel and check the wiring!

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.950
Repairing the Zeta
looks like tough work.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:57.330
With the Methuss down and the Zeta
in this condition, I'm getting worried.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.330
Sorry.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.210
But with the La Vie en Rose coming,
we'll manage somehow.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.920
Aside from that, what are
Judau and the others up to?

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.880
Weren't they helping you here?

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.260
There they are!

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.430
- Honestly!
- Would you shut up?

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:13.680
Now look, Captain Bright told you to go
to the La Vie en Rose, didn't he?

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:17.140
It's hard to use the bathroom
with a normal suit on!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.140
You can do it in
your suit, can't you?

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.190
Idiot!

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.360
Roux!

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.150
What is it?

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:27.490
And you fool around the minute
my eyes are off you, Judau!

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.700
You'll never be a good crewman!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.700
Who said I'm a crewman?

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.330
- Then pay for your meals!
- That again?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.830
What is it?

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.500
When can the Core Fighter leave?

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.870
You're going to the La Vie en Rose
to get our new mobile suit, right?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.460
What do you think
I'm prepping for right now?

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.380
What's the new suit like?

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.800
I don't know.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:49.880
- I'll go too.
- The Core Fighter only seats one.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.390
Judau, help repair the Zeta!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:57.140
Miss Fa, loosen up or no guy
will ever look at you.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.440
Oh, and I suppose you think you're
adorable with all your screwups!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:04.730
A cool gal who screws up
occasionally is adorable.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:08.110
Oh, please! You like to
talk yourself up, don't you?

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.820
Go back to Shangri-La.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:17.410
You should stay with Kamille, Miss Fa.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.210
Just go make contact with
the La Vie en Rose!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.330
That's your job, isn't it?

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.670
Sure, whatever!

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.960
That girl is such a little brat!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.260
Roux! Please don't
get lost this time.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:33.390
Captain, you should worry about
things aboard the Argama instead.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.180
Meaning what?

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.760
Ready to launch.
Should we send her out?

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:38.560
R-Right.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.730
Hey, Roux!

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.230
Roux Louka, moving out!

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.780
What was she implying?

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:51.950
Huh? The Argama's
transmitting something?

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:55.780
The wavelength's unstable...
No one should be in communication now.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.080
"New model coming."

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:01.290
Right. "New model coming."
This is the Argama!

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.040
"We want to make
a deal with you."

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.800
"We want to make
a deal with you."

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.130
"Hurry! New model is coming!"

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.130
Why, you!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.430
You?! Get up!

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:22.100
If you tell the Argama crew about this,
we won't see one penny!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.980
I'm not going to tell them!
But please, don't do this!

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:29.480
Didn't you understand me when
I said we'd get a ton of cash...

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.230
for selling the Argama
to the enemy?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:35.490
But if you sell them to Axis,
everyone here will be taken prisoner!

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.370
And they'll wreck the Earth!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:42.000
Selling out one ship isn't
going to destroy the Earth!

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.120
- Mondo! Gimme some rope.
- Right.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.840
Stop it! Why do you
have to tie me up?!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.800
Because your face can't lie.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:54.420
Mondo, keep sending that signal.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.510
We'll give the Endra
the Argama's position.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.550
I said I was on it!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.100
This won't take long.

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.600
The other ship should
pick up this signal soon.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.440
This political game the adults
play has nothing to do with us.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:15.360
Better to live the good life on
some other colony, right, Iino?

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.320
But...!

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.910
That's how it is, Mashymre.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:28.170
You can't keep making
glib excuses forever.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.420
You're saying if I don't establish
a stronghold at Shangri-La,

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.260
I'll be demoted?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.340
Exactly. Most likely.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:41.220
I intend to carry out
Lady Haman's orders.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:44.350
But I'd regret not giving
this task all I have.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:48.140
You're not definitively told that just yet.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:50.440
So take a gamble
with your last chance.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:54.030
But the Hamma-Hamma
has its limits in battle.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:57.950
Then will you just leave
things as they stand, Mashymre?

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.990
Lady Haman won't forgive you.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.870
Would you stop that?!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.330
So naïve.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.040
Is that the rose
Lady Haman gave you?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:14.550
You had it coated in resin and
kept it all this time, haven't you?

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:17.010
I'm jealous.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:19.590
Lady Haman is the
only woman for me!

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:24.060
You look so cute when you say
such silly things. Here.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.480
St-Stop that!
What are you doing?!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.610
You think Lady Haman
will keep handing out roses...

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.730
to people who don't
carry out her will?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:40.910
Wh-What is it?!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.950
Master Mashymre.

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:45.950
We picked up another signal.
It had a message this time.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.200
I... I see.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.960
Then I'll go out
in the Hamma-Hamma.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.290
Prepare a liaison for the collaborator.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.960
I can handle that.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:56.000
Gottn? This will be
a dangerous task.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.010
It could be life-threatening.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:00.090
I'm prepared for that, sir.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.800
You'd do that for me...?

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.220
Master Mashymre!

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.310
You...

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:10.640
You're a dedicated man, Gottn.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.940
Yes, ma'am! I'm ready to
die to carry out my duty.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.150
Such reliable...

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.650
Chara Soon.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.910
Watch and see as
I defeat the Argama!

00:08:22.950 --> 00:08:26.120
And when I do, you can
change that overbearing attitude!

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.540
You know what this is, Mashymre?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.330
Chara Soon.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.630
Watch and see as
I defeat the Argama!

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:37.500
And when I do, you can
change that overbearing attitude!

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:43.340
It'll be my report to Lady Haman.
This task is her orders, too.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.140
Of all the dirty...!

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:46.890
Lady Haman, you mean?

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:49.850
Let's go, Gottn!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:50.730
Sir!

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.360
See you later!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.820
Sorry, but piloting mobile
suits wears me out.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.610
Hope things work out, Mashymre!

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:03.200
You're being way too annoying!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.530
There's nothing wrong
with being extra careful!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:08.120
This is to protect your
own life, you know!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.200
C'mon, we'll help you.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.250
Right!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.540
Haven't you two finished
handing out the lunches yet?!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.340
We couldn't find
Beecha and the others.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:20.340
Serves them right for goofing off.
Do the laundry!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.050
But Iino doesn't goof off!

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:26.220
If you have time to talk back,
you have time to do the wash!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.970
We can't spare the power to
run the washing machines!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.600
We're doing the best we can!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.890
Leina, don't!

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.350
Judau! Don't you
start goofing off now!

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:41.740
What's with Old Lady
Cranky Pants today?!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.570
I didn't come here
to do laundry!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.530
- Don't take it so hard.
- Fa's just in a bad mood.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.540
Fa! Bad mood! Bad mood!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.040
That's right! Leina was
just telling the truth!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:59.540
Beecha and Mondo eat so much
it's no biggie if they miss a meal or...

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.420
Leina! Take care
of the wash, okay?

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:05.340
Ditching work?!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.720
It's okay.
I like doing laundry.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.100
You're really mature, Leina.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:14.020
Elle has really good
intuition about things.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:19.810
I don't see anything yet,
but that signal's still going.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.730
It should lead us to the Argama.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:25.490
Aye, sir.
We're monitoring it as well.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.620
Where did you go?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.950
Where? Well...

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.290
Well, we're free
individuals, right?

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.710
Oh, is that so? Well then,
you don't get a meal!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.960
That's not fair!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.590
If you don't like it,
tell me what you're doing.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.630
Depending on the situation,
I can cooperate in return.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:47.430
Or, I can always take it up
with the captain.

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:49.220
The enemy?

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.850
It's an alert!
Let's go!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:52.970
Wait!

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:55.560
Are our mobile suits ready to go?

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:57.230
Increase the number
of dummy asteroids!

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.230
Aye, aye!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.310
It's strange. There's a signal.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.650
A signal? Deal with any
malfunctions later!

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.650
- Aye, sir!
- Beecha! Mondo!

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:07.740
Dammit,
I need to get a suit on...

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:17.120
Say, we should probably take care
of those dummy asteroids, huh?

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.630
We're nearly in sight.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:26.340
Gottn, watch your step.
Don't get yourself killed.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.680
Then release me, sir.
I can handle the rest.

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.640
How do I get myself
into these messes?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:50.030
Dammit! Covering for a dumb-ass superior
can be hazardous to your health!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.540
I'm opening it.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.750
Okay.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.720
Come on, you stupid backpack!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.640
Huh? Did the attachment
come off?

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.350
What are you doing?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.730
My backpack!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:23.150
Oh, you're hopeless.
I need to tell you something!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:23.860
What?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:28.150
- Elle, get changed and man a turret!
- Lay off, Granny Shoot 'Em Up!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:29.740
What was that?!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.530
Whoa! We got hit?!
Elle, get a normal suit on!

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:34.370
R-Right!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.910
We got grazed!
It was a beam rifle!

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.540
What's keeping the Zeta?!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.330
Judau!
What are you doing?!

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:43.580
Captain! Put on a normal suit
before you get killed!

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.750
Man, I never
get a break, do I?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.010
Judau, wait!
This is important!

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.920
Zeta, launch already!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.010
I know!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.550
Caesar, the Zeta's not finished!

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:57.560
It'll move.
Miss Fa, protect the Argama!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.390
Make use of dummy asteroids.
Do you--

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:00.600
Got it!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.940
That beam rifle
hasn't been plugged in!

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.110
Takeoff bearing to 3 o'clock!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.950
Be careful of the dummy asteroids
with the bombs on them!

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.240
Do I have to be that careful?

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.120
A bomb dummy!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.250
Did a stray shot blow it up?

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.260
You don't have to help Judau's Zeta!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.640
It was an accident!
My aim shouldn't be that good.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:37.100
Dammit!

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.600
It's not firing!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:52.990
What's going on?!
I can't fight like this!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:03.120
I'm going out!
Get a beam rifle plug ready!

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.960
Going out in the Methuss
will get you killed!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.500
We can't just stand here
and watch Judau die!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.300
Fa Yuiry!
Methuss, moving out!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.510
You're crazy!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:16.340
Without this plug,
the Zeta can't work!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.260
Captain?

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:18.640
Send her out!
She can do it!

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:36.700
Made it.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.200
It worked!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:48.460
Hey! Do you see any
other mobile suits?

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.630
Fa's just launched!

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.340
Hey! One of them
got killed!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.460
Aw, man.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:55.510
We need to take those
dummy asteroids out, fast!

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:56.720
Keep shooting!

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.470
Right!

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:05.390
Get on a turret!
We've got incoming!

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.730
That's not an
Argama normal suit!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:19.360
I'm not letting you guys do what you want!
I've got the power advantage here!

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:22.740
Go!

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.710
See? You shouldn't
get carried away!

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.580
Over here, Judau!
On your left!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.380
What? Right!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.340
Upper left!
Another one's coming!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:43.550
Why are my Gaza-Cs
having so much trouble?!

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:46.600
I told them to shoot down all
the dummy asteroids near us!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.900
No, you don't!

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:00.910
I should be close.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:08.250
I'll find out what he's up to
and give ol' Fa a nice surprise!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.790
I've found you, Zeta!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:12.790
What?!

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:17.300
Hm? He can't use his rifle?

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.220
In that case...!

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.050
Coward! You flee?!

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:27.060
Even after I challenged you
fairly with a beam saber?

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:33.730
Damn you, Argama!
You're using your main guns?!

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:36.980
We'd better get
normal suits on, too.

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:37.940
Yeah.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.740
Who was that?!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.160
Ow!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.950
Some parts are disconnected
right in here.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.620
How long will this take?

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.120
I don't know!

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:56.540
Hey, maybe we should just get
out of here in our escape pods.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:17:00.090
Once you sit in the Zeta,
your duty is to defeat the enemy!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:03.130
If you don't,
you'll die in space!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.160
Fa! He's found us!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.570
Almost got it!

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.370
There you are!

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:44.630
By this rose on my chest,
I shall defeat you!

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:46.050
Zeta, prepare yourself!

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.640
Wh-What the...?!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.560
Right! I have you!

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.020
I did it, Judau!

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.610
Cover the Zeta!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:09.160
We can't track them that fast
in the middle of this mess!

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.410
Judau!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:12.830
Fa!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.460
Judau! Take this!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.340
No, you don't!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.260
Fa!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.010
Dammit!

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:36.350
His beam rifle works!
Was it just an act?!

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:39.730
It's no use!
The controls won't work!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.020
Fa!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:44.240
Judau, the Argama!
Leave me for later!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.030
Right. I'll be back.
Don't get spotted!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.290
Party's over!

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:10.300
You're not getting me!
If I die, everyone else dies!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.140
Caesar, track Fa's position!

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.220
We can't rescue Fa
with all this going on!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.060
What?!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.190
Single unit, inbound from
the La Vie en Rose!

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:27.780
What's...?

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.820
Zeta, get back!

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.540
That thing packs a punch!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.950
Zeta! Behind you!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:36.410
Huh?!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.250
Well? Surprised, Judau?

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:46.210
What happened to
the Core Fighter?

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.840
This is the Core Fighter.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:50.760
We'll talk later. Let's go.

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:53.640
lt's Roux!
Roux Louka has returned!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:57.180
Captain! The Methuss is drifting
towards Shangri-La!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.140
Towards Shangri-La?

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:00.020
Good.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:02.360
The enemy ship is still close by.
Deploy more dummies!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:08.240
So, reinforcements have arrived.

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:11.700
But the Hamma-Hamma can't fight now!

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.700
We're getting wiped out!
Master Mashymre!

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:16.040
But...!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.620
Let's leave the rest
to Gottn, since he's in.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.120
Yes! You're right!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:24.340
Gottn risked his life
infiltrating that ship.

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.050
I have no doubt
he'll take the Argama.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:29.380
That will shut Chara Soon up, for sure!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:36.140
Are you our collaborator?

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.140
Did the Argama crew
find you out? Hang on.

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.690
Help!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.520
You idiot!
I'm on your side!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:45.860
Iino!

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.990
Damn, you stupid kids...!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:58.580
Now that the enemy's retreated,
I'm going to recover the Methuss.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:20:59.580
Leave it!

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:00.580
Why?!

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.250
If you go, the enemy
might spot you instead.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:05.130
That would endanger
both you and the Methuss!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.210
But Fa will die!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.550
She's fine.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.590
We spotted the Methuss's
lights inside Side 1's airspace.

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:14.390
One of those colonies
is sure to pick her up.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:19.430
Fa... Miss Fa saved my life.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.100
So, write her a
thank-you letter later on.

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.270
She's not coming back?!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.400
I think that's the
best thing for her.

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:32.950
She has someone to
take care of, after all.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.660
Yeah... Kamille Bidan.

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.450
That's right.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.740
Did this man say anything?

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.790
Yeah. Well...

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:46.420
He said he came aboard to
make contact with a collaborator.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.920
Collaborator? A spy?

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:53.590
Yeah. One of your crew
is helping the Endra.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:56.640
I think Iino knows who it is,
but he isn't talking.

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:06.650
Judau can take care of them.

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:10.270
Farewell, everyone aboard the Argama.

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:28.080
I'm going back there.

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:51.400
Gottn has a busy day, stealing
a Core Fighter and capturing Iino.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:53.030
And Mashymre shows up, too!

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.610
But Iino's no fool!

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:58.160
He's brought us more parts
from the La Vie en Rose!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:03.620
Good for him! And then, this little
fighter-looking thing is finally... Finally!

00:24:03.990 --> 00:24:08.500
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Activate! Double Zeta."

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:09.070
ACTIVATE! DOUBLE ZETA

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:09.070
Next Time

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:11.710
Did you see how
I sliced that asteroid?!
